nd apps',1,'Recommend applications based on user models.','Recommend applications based on user models.',NULL,'5E44B0AEA92811EDAD98FA163E7E62B7','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce6591a-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','BAA6533B2DF811EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'9868b6dc8d3eed808d0868683aa85382','网络基本信息(移动网络号码)','Basic network information(Mobile network number)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'e6fa3c30c5528f517110768d2c3f7061','设备信息','Device Information',1,'FD659102AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','网络信息','Network Information',1,'C4','C4','L2','L2','S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'The Mobile Network Code (MNC) from the user\'s IMSI number associated with their SIM card, used to determine the user\'s home country in scenarios where they are not logged in.','与用户SIM卡关联的IMSI号码中的移动网络码（MNC），用于在用户未登录场景下判断其归属的国家',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce659bb-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','09382ac84043476fa21192ce4a7d4083',1,'3f93ec6aa6fd98eb676b0a215f871630','UDID(UDID)','UDID(UDID)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'e6fa3c30c5528f517110768d2c3f7061','设备信息','Device Information',1,'FD656800AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','开发者随机标识','Random ID of a developer',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'Serves as a unique identifier for the user\'s device. The UDID is not stored separately. Instead, it is used as a primary key when storing device-related information (such as PushToken) or included in event tracking data, used for device-level statistical analysis.','作为用户设备的唯一标识。UDID不单独存储，而是在存储设备相关信息（如PushToken）时，作为主键使用；或者在包含在打点数据中，用于设备级的统计分析',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','服务级秘钥加密','Pseudonym By Using Server-Key','1'),('9ce65a6a-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','CF3A2660571011EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'deccc2ed12a7ca68d81fdb719f2a8979','教育行为记录(学习记录)','Records of Educational Behavior(Learning Records)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955C57AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用记录','Application/Service Usage Records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容学习','Content Learning',1,'If users study a course in a third-party CP\'s app and that course is already available on EduCenter, the third-party CP can synchronize the study records to EduCenter. This allows EduCenter to display the same study records and progress. At the same time, this data can be used for personalized course recommendations within EduCenter.','如果用户在三方CP的App内学习了课程且该课程已经在教育中心上架，三方CP可以将学习记录同步到教育中心，用于教育中心内可以呈现相同的学习记录和进度；同时可以基于该数据进行个性化推荐',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce65b1e-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','D94D23CAC44411EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'a8f112df6282f47a427907aa4d455fb0','学习笔记和资料(查词翻译记录)','Study notes and materials(Dictionary Lookup Record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD95567CAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户公开发布的内容','Publicly published content by users',1,'C1','C1',NULL,NULL,'S1','S1','学习服务','Learning Services',1,'Words and sentences entered by users in the Chinese dictionary and English dictionary features, intended for search.','用户在汉语词典、英语词典功能中输入的待查询的单词、句子',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce65bb1-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','35D340162DF711EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'e85fabc1fb6cdbda0f0345727a3dac99','系统基本设置信息(服务地)','Basic system settings(Service Location)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'e6fa3c30c5528f517110768d2c3f7061','设备信息','Device Information',1,'FD658BD7AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','设备设置及状态信息','Device settings and status information',1,'C2','C2','L2','L2','S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'Service location information set in the user\'s Huawei account. EduCenter currently only provides services for users in mainland China. If the user\'s service location is outside mainland China, they need to be prompted and guided to switch their service location.','用户华为帐号中设置的服务地信息。教育中心当前仅为中国大陆用户提供服务，当用户的服务地非中国大陆中，需要提示用户，引导用户切换服务地。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce65c80-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','233F0BA5072A11ECAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'a8f112df6282f47a427907aa4d455fb0','学习笔记和资料(用户错题本)','Study notes and materials(Collection of Wrong Question)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD95567CAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户公开发布的内容','Publicly published content by users',1,'C1','C1',NULL,NULL,'S1','S1','学习服务','Learning Services',1,'Wrong questions added by users in the \'Mistake Book\' feature. Once added, they can be used for subsequent corrections, assembling into test papers, printing, and other functions.','用户在错题本功能中添加的错题，添加后可用于后续订正，组卷打印等功能。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce65d1f-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','89F71BF82ED111EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'9479af520ab0c08daeba641e05b8a80a','教师信息(教师信息)','Instructor Information(Instructor Information)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'081836D4AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','企业数据','Enterprise data',1,'FD957D94AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','商业公开个人信息','Business Disclosure Personal Information',1,'C1','C1','L1','L1','S1','S1','内容管理','Content Management',1,'Teacher information for courses uploaded by CP, including the teacher\'s avatar, name, introduction, etc. They are used to display to users on the client side.','CP上传的课程的教师信息，包括教师的头像，名字，介绍等；用于在客户端上向用户展示。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce65dbd-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','16A0882D563C11EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'589ac4d1cc17a51390cf2cbbde9f32f9','用户语音(音频数据流)','User voice(Audio data stream)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'08145E60AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户私有内容','User private content',1,'FD95730BAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','数字资产','Digital Assets',1,'C3','C3',NULL,NULL,'S3','S3','用户测评','User Measurement & Evaluation (3rd Party Scenario)',1,'Audio data from users\' readings and conversations in the oral assessment, situational dialogue, and vocabulary learning features. They are used for functions such as oral evaluation, human-machine dialogue, and pronunciation correction.','口语测评，情景对话，字词学习功能中用户的朗读和对话音频数据。用于实现口语测评、人机对话、读音批改等功能。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','服务级秘钥加密','Pseudonym By Using Server-Key','0'),('9ce65ed3-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','36731BE12E4A11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'c020b58e920663b1744b3caed2212204','客服交流记录(机器人客服记录)','Customer Service Communication Record(Robot customer service record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955CCBAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','客服记录','Customer service records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','帮助与客服','Help & Customer Service',1,'To save the live chat records between the user and the AI customer support in the \"Help and Customer Service\" feature','保存用户在“帮助与客服“功能中与智能客服的交流记录',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','服务级秘钥加密','Pseudonym By Using Server-Key','0'),('9ce65f88-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','76408B352E3D11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'62ce27910507dd3e2c3be6528e81c32d','地址信息(收货地址)','Address information(Ship To Address)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'08149A6CAAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','个人基本资料','Basic personal information',1,'FD65A5C8AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','自然人联系方式','Contact information of natural persons',1,'C3','C3','L2','L2','S2','S2','个人设置','Personal Settings',1,'Users who win physical prizes in promotional activities. Their phone numbers and delivery addresses are collected, used for sending the physical prizes.','在运营活动中中得实物奖品的用户，需要收集其电话号码以及快递地址，用于发送实物奖品',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','服务级秘钥加密','Pseudonym By Using Server-Key','2'),('9ce66173-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','75AD10E79DBF11EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'2fa4f9e9ddb6a1d46f3eb4651f46a50b','华为账号ID(华为账号ID)','Huawei ID(Huawei ID)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'08151ABEAAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','账号信息','Account information',1,'FD65657AAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','华为账号标识','Huawei Account ID',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'Used to uniquely identify a logged-in user. The Huawei account ID is not stored separately. Instead, it is used as a primary key when storing other user-related data.','用于唯一标识一个已登录用户。华为帐号ID不单独存储，而是存储其他与用户相关的数据时，作为主键使用。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','1'),('9ce66226-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','89ABE36F2E3311EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'c020b58e920663b1744b3caed2212204','客服交流记录(问题与建议)','Customer Service Communication Record(Problem Description)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955CCBAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','客服记录','Customer service records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','帮助与客服','Help & Customer Service',1,'Users provide problem descriptions, screenshots, and contact information in the \'Feedback and Suggestions\' feature. They are used to identify specific issues and contact users when necessary.','用户在“问题与建议”功能中提供的问题描述、截图和联系方式，用于确认具体问题并在必要时与用户进行联系',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce662e0-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','0F4CA0792E4E11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'d8969c84e6337ccc02be5eece892337b','应用设置信息(应用个性化开关设置)','Application setting information(Apply Personalization Switch Settings)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD658AF4AB2011EFA3BCFA1