ication Record(Customer Service Communication Record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955CCBAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','客服记录','Customer service records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','帮助与客服','Help & Customer Service',1,'Users\' communication records with online customer service in the \'Help and Customer Service\' feature. They are saved to document specific feedback and the handling process, used for verification and auditing purposes.','用户在“帮助与客服”功能中与在线客服的沟通记录，保存用户反馈的具体问题及处理过程，用于时候的证明、审计目的',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce665f3-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','B4CCEB503DED11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'54595eaa046d4695652e6086dd602f37','云服务自有内容收藏记录(云服务自有内容收藏记录)','Cloud Service Content Favorites Record(Cloud Service Content Favorites Record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955C57AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用记录','Application/Service Usage Records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容浏览','Content Browsing',1,'List of courses added by users to their favorites. They are used for users to view, purchase, and study later.','用户添加到收藏夹中的课程列表，用于用户后续查看、购买和学习',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66689-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','5D1657229DC211EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'51135b2ff85b7e9c3ea2a498e625c137','学习计划(课程表)','Learning Plan(Course Schedule)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD95567CAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户公开发布的内容','Publicly published content by users',1,'C1','C1',NULL,NULL,'S1','S1','学习服务','Learning Services',1,'Class schedules entered by users manually or imported through photos. They are used for subsequent viewing.','用户通过手工录入，拍照导入等方式录入的课程表，用于后续查看',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66723-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','7C4255612E3611EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'5de706a9ecd127a16b0ada5d79b63d0b','应用本地日志(异常日志记录|应用日志文件)','APP local log(Exception log recording|Application log files)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD658AF4AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用设置及状态信息','Application settings and status information',1,'C2','C2','L2','L2','S2','S2','帮助与客服','Help & Customer Service',1,'Users\' local log files are uploaded in the \'Feedback and Suggestions\' feature. They are used for troubleshooting purposes.','在“问题与建议”功能中用户上传的客户端本地日志文件，用于辅助问题定位',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce667c3-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','3A10EF893DF211EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'3f93c9e3f9a0989166039dccd5053f22','基于华为账号的OpenID(基于华为账号的OpenID)','Huawei ID-based OpenID(Huawei ID-based OpenID)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'08151ABEAAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','账号信息','Account information',1,'FD65657AAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','华为账号标识','Huawei Account ID',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'The openId associated with the user\'s Huawei account and a specific third-party app. It is used to uniquely identify a user when synchronizing subscription relationships with third-party CPs.','用户华为帐号与特定三方App关联的openId。用于在与三方CP同步订购关系时，唯一标识一个用户',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','不存储','Not Stored','1'),('9ce6685d-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','1B49A53C2DF211EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'cc267cf6d780c54b17968b890aec1a34','粗略地理位置(粗略位置)','rough geographical location(rough location)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'08226A02AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','位置信息','Location information',1,'FD6592F0AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','粗略位置信息','Rough location information',1,'C2','C2','L2','L2','S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'User\'s approximate location determined by their IP address (accurate to the city/district/county level). It is used to recommend suitable course content and textbook versions based on the user\'s location.','根据用户IP地址查询到的用户粗略位置（精确到市/区/县级别），用于根据用户所处位置推荐适合的课程内容、教材版本',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','不存储','Not Stored','2'),('9ce668f9-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','474B51F42E4F11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'29cd181aab3d81b461f0f87bbc8ff161','订单信息(交易记录)','Order Information(Transactions)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'3c72348f1243b9fe6899c88afcc76fbc','交易信息','Transaction Information',1,'FD955A64AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','订单信息','Order Information',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容&服务购买','Content Purchasing',1,'Course purchase records obtained from third-party CPs, reflecting user transactions on the CP\'s side. Based on this data, users can directly study purchased courses in EduCenter.','从第三方CP获取到的用户在该CP侧产生的课程购买记录。基于该数据可以支持用户直接在教育中心学习已购的课程',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66998-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','45CEEEB3571111EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'47f747d4603f62e8b1931219ca4a9b10','应用使用记录(曝光记录)','Application Usage Record(exposure record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955C57AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用记录','Application/Service Usage Records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容浏览','Content Browsing',1,'Exposure records of courses, learning services, sports activities, and other information displayed on the user\'s client. They are used to generate statistical reports and provide personalized recommendations based on user browsing behavior.','用户客户端上展示的课程、学习服务、运动活动等信息的曝光记录，用于生成统计报表，以及基于用户浏览行为进行个性化推荐',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66a38-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','200D376F2E0211EB