ers can then select from this list to associate a child account with the child role they\'ve established.','华为帐号中创建的家庭群组信息。通过家庭群组获取用户创建的儿童帐号列表，用户可以从该列表中选择儿童帐号来关联到其创建的孩子角色',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','不存储','Not Stored','2'),('9ce66c05-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','7495F4C9A0F111EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'51135b2ff85b7e9c3ea2a498e625c137','学习计划(学习计划)','Learning Plan(Learning Plan)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD95567CAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户公开发布的内容','Publicly published content by users',1,'C1','C1',NULL,NULL,'S1','S1','内容学习','Content Learning',1,'User\'s course study plan. EduCenter sends study reminders to users based on their plan.','用户设置的课程学习计划，教育中心根据计划对用户进行学习提醒',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66c9a-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','F38CC80DCFDE11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'29cd181aab3d81b461f0f87bbc8ff161','订单信息(订阅记录)','Order Information(Subcription Record)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'3c72348f1243b9fe6899c88afcc76fbc','交易信息','Transaction Information',1,'FD955A64AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','订单信息','Order Information',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容&服务购买','Content Purchasing',1,'Subscription records for children\'s memberships and learning service packages. They are used for rights verification and service fulfillment','儿童会员、学习服务套餐的订阅记录，用于权益校验和服务履行',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66d3f-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','FCD3EBC5571011EC8D01FA163E7E62B7',1,'deccc2ed12a7ca68d81fdb719f2a8979','教育行为记录(学习记录)','Records of Educational Behavior(Learning Records)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD955C57AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用记录','Application/Service Usage Records',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容学习','Content Learning',1,'User\'s course study records within EduCenter. They are used to display the list of courses the user is currently studying, making it easier for users to quickly find the relevant course. At the same time, personalized course recommendations are made based on the user\'s study behavior. When the course originates from Huawei Music, the course study records need to be synchronized to Huawei Music for settlement with its CP based on play counts.','用户在教育中心内的课程学习记录。用于为用户展示正在学习的课程列表，方便用户快速找到相应课程；同时基于用户的学习行为进行个性化课程推荐。当课程来源与华为音乐时，课程的学习记录需要同步到华为音乐，用于华为音乐按播放量与其CP进行结算。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce66df0-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','0A25D5392E3A11EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'1c56e14a5649ba63ae82ca23f364b718','用户权益信息(折扣券)','User rights information(Discount coupon)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'3c72348f1243b9fe6899c88afcc76fbc','交易信息','Transaction Information',1,'FD956280AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','权益信息','Equity Information',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容&服务购买','Content Purchasing',1,'Coupon information existing on the user\'s account. They are used to display to users on the client side and to automatically select the best coupon for users during payment.','用户帐号上已有的优惠券信息。用于在客户端上显示给用户查看，已经在支付时自动为用户选择最佳的优惠券进行支付',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','不存储','Not Stored','0'),('9ce66f10-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','D360361607AD11ECAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'a8f112df6282f47a427907aa4d455fb0','学习笔记和资料(用户字词本)','Study notes and materials(User Wordbook)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'0814A351AAF911EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','应用/服务使用数据','Application/Service usage data',1,'FD95567CAB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','用户公开发布的内容','Publicly published content by users',1,'C1','C1',NULL,NULL,'S1','S1','学习服务','Learning Services',1,'New characters and words added by users through the Chinese character book and English word book features. Once added, they