ly guard the child.','用户在家长关怀功能中创建和加入的守护群组信息。守护群组中包含群组管理员创建的孩子角色，以及群组管理员邀请的可以共同对孩子进行守护的其他家庭成员',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce672d4-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','AECF465A2DF811EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'9868b6dc8d3eed808d0868683aa85382','网络基本信息(移动信号国家码)','Basic network information(Mobile Signal Country Code)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'e6fa3c30c5528f517110768d2c3f7061','设备信息','Device Information',1,'FD659102AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','网络信息','Network Information',1,'C4','C4','L2','L2','S2','S2','基础服务','Basic  Service',1,'The Mobile Country Code (MCC) from the user\'s IMSI number associated with their SIM card, used to determine the user\'s home country in scenarios where they are not logged in.','与用户SIM卡关联的IMSI号码中的移动国家码（MCC），用于在用户未登录场景下判断其归属的国家',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','2'),('9ce67375-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','61DF1C412E5211EBAA75FA163E7E62B7',1,'29cd181aab3d81b461f0f87bbc8ff161','订单信息(交易记录)','Order Information(Transactions)',1,'D980D75553A345328AA6CC547BCFA9C9','个人数据','Personal Data',1,'3c72348f1243b9fe6899c88afcc76fbc','交易信息','Transaction Information',1,'FD955A64AB2011EFA3BCFA163E8B650F','订单信息','Order Information',1,'C2','C2',NULL,NULL,'S2','S2','内容&服务购买','Content Purchasing',1,'Users\' course purchase records, used for purchase relationship authentication during learning. When a course needs to be studied within a third-party CP\'s application after purchase, EduCenter will synchronize the course purchase records to the third-party CP. For courses synchronized from Huawei Video, the purchase relationship will also be synchronized to Huawei Video after the user makes a purchase.','用户的课程购买记录，用于在学习时进行购买关系鉴权。当课程购买后需要再第三方CP的应用内进行学习时，教育中心会将课程购买记录同步给三方CP。对于从华为视频同步的课程，用户购买后会将购买关系也同步到华为视频。',NULL,'80106','1','上云处理','cloud-based processing','明文(含Hash)','Plaintext','0'),('9ce67422-4508-11f0-8fd2-fa163ebb1419','E6BBD6932E0511EBAA75FA163E7E62B7